      "value": "Slipstream Generator"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "text": "Slipstream Generator",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " is a marvel of air magic. \n\nWhen placed, it affects an area 50 blocks in front of the vortex face, in a single block column. "
        },
        {
          "text": "It works horizontally as well as vertically",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nAdditional generators stacked opposite the vortex (for example directly below when facing up) will collectively increase the range of the effect. \n\nWizards that stand within this column will be grabbed by the slipstream. "
        },
        {
          "text": "The wizard moves by looking in the direction of the slipstream, both forwards and reverse",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nThe speed of raising and lowering is dependent on how much a wizard looks toward the direction of a slipstream. \n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Crouching will lock the wizard in place",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the slipstream, allowing them to look around or interact without being moved by the slipstream itself."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "manaweaving_altar",
      "location": "mna:manaweaving/artifice/slipstream_generator"
    }
  ]
}